        "slc_d68d27952c15fc0a4e0e480fe06a3511093218143464912b7efb8933a48a13a0"
      ],
      "text": "The product is deliberately agent-agnostic: it does not speak any agent's protocol or parse agent output, treating a pane as just a pane so the terminal layer survives agent-tooling churn."
    },
