        "slc_212d836a751988c07bc4d83653d1a10db14708f54f3bcbd04bd04ed589a050d4"
      ],
      "text": "`rk riff` supports repeatable `--skill`/`--cmd` flags (one pane each, in argv order), `--layout` (auto, tiled, even-*, main-*), presets in `fab/project/config.yaml`, `-N` parallel spawning with rollback on failure, and `--` passthrough of flags to `wt create`."
