      "text": "`rk serve` is configurable via `RK_HOST` (default 127.0.0.1) and `RK_PORT` (default 3000), and background operation is provided by `rk daemon` subcommands (start, restart, stop, status) running in a dedicated `rk-daemon` tmux server."
