      ],
      "text": "Repository development practice: a post-mortem documents that a 59-file PR passed all gates (Go, tsc, ~3,590 vitest tests, two Playwright suites, build) yet needed ten review cycles against a budget of three, and recommends splitting changes by risk class and manually exercising new interaction components before ship."
    },
